<section class="c-sec position" id="position" aria-labelledby="pos-heading" data-screen-label="02 Position">
  <div class="position-inner">
    <aside class="position-aside">
      <div class="c-label">§ 02 — Position</div>
      <div class="position-num" aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="0.06">02</div>
    </aside>
    <div>
      <p class="position-lead" id="pos-heading">
        We do not sell theory.<br>
        We sell decisions, direction,<br>and the confidence to execute.
      </p>
      <ul class="pcp-list" aria-label="Our principles">
        <li class="pcp-row">
          <span class="pcp-n">01</span>
          <span class="pcp-v">Brutal honesty</span>
          <span class="pcp-x">over diplomatic ambiguity</span>
          <span class="pcp-d"><span>We tell you when the brief is wrong, the hire is wrong, the strategy is wrong. Diplomatic protects the consultant; we protect the work.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="pcp-row">
          <span class="pcp-n">02</span>
          <span class="pcp-v">Precision</span>
          <span class="pcp-x">over volume</span>
          <span class="pcp-d"><span>One sharp recommendation that changes a decision beats twelve hedged ones that change nothing. We send a memo, not a deck.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="pcp-row">
          <span class="pcp-n">03</span>
          <span class="pcp-v">Speed</span>
          <span class="pcp-x">over perfection</span>
          <span class="pcp-d"><span>Live in 21 days. Shelf-ready in 90. The right answer shipped is worth more than the perfect answer in a deck.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="pcp-row">
          <span class="pcp-n">04</span>
          <span class="pcp-v">Accountability</span>
          <span class="pcp-x">over evasion</span>
          <span class="pcp-d"><span>If what we built isn't working, we fix it. The mandate ends when the work outlives us, not when the retainer expires.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="pcp-row">
          <span class="pcp-n">05</span>
          <span class="pcp-v">Practical intelligence</span>
          <span class="pcp-x">over borrowed frameworks</span>
          <span class="pcp-d"><span>We've run the brands, the supply chains, the campaigns, the farms. The advice you get is the playbook we used — not what a book says you should try.</span></span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
